2021 has been jam-packed with finding  new things in breath of the wild despite  it being almost five years since it  launched and every year there are  hundreds of glitches discovered that  you've never heard of so i'll cover a  variety of minor and major finds this  year that you might not have seen before  if you enjoy breath of the wild content  let us know with a like now let's go  back to the beginning of the year  early in january of 2021 glitch hunters  such as kinok and yuda were still hot on  the heels of a major glitch found in  late 2020 called memory storage a glitch  that allowed players to start a brand  new game with the bow of light and all  of their equipment basically a new game  plus but this glitch led to a number of  other discoveries that paved the way to  break the game even more one of which  was called inventory corruption by the  middle of january players were finding  out that by performing the memory  storage glitch then gaining some extra  slots through hesto durability values  would carry over strangely to the new  file such as with shield durability into  arrow counts a nice way to start a new  file with a massive quiver  yiga sword stealing while its popularity  exploded later in june 2021 this glitch  was actually discovered quietly by bot w  in january this trick proves that the  yiga blade masters in the yiga hideout  have the capability of confiscating  pretty much any weapon including the  legendary master sword by clipping into  the yiga hideout then kiting the blade  master all the way to the korok forest  you can cause them to yank the powerful  sword right out of the pedestal  a strange glitch called super hold  smuggling is discovered by let me think  of a username by using a multitude of  glitches to warp link's coordinates then  smuggling an item at the exact same time  link then goes into a strange state of  permanently holding an item in the menu  this state led to another discovery by  axk who found that this could be  combined with an old camera glitch to  play breath of the wild in first person  a brand new way to play the game  a nifty trick user snsk2s found called  golden gauntlets arrives on the scene by  tricking the game to pick up heavy items  with the bomb pickup animation instead  you can pick up and carry previously  heavy objects with ease and throw them  even farther this glitch was named after  a famous piece of equipment in ocarina  of time where golden gauntlets allowed  link to lift extremely heavy things with  no effort  another trick snsk2s found was unarmed  link which causes the game to think you  have a weapon equipped in your hand but  actually is instead put away and  sheathed on your back at the same time  this is caused by entering the tie flow  ruins border at the exact same time you  pick up a bomb which interrupts your  shooting animation but the game still  thinks they have the weapon equipped  mostly a useless glitch but can lead to  some comedic chase scenes  the summer months of june and july for  breath of the wild were packed with  discoveries one of which was bomb hole  displacement satogashi found out that by  scoping then summoning a bomb quickly  next to an object makes the bomb spawn  inside of the object pushing either link  or the object quickly away from each  other this could be used to push and  launch items or push link to gain bullet  time  in breath of the wild there are hundreds  of hidden treasure chests but there are  also a handful of them that weren't  properly placed during development and  were impossible to get many of them have  been reached over the years through  advances in glitches but the final one  at heiress beach seemed impossible until  a user cleric used a multitude of  techniques ranging from quality clipping  moon jumping rune recharging and a ton  of patience to push the final treasure  chest into his hands  [Music]  octo balloon duplication was found by  satogashi by taking advantage of the  octo balloons attachment mechanic  dropping weapons on them at specific  times made the weapon be able to be  picked up two times in a row making it  one of the more efficient ways to  duplicate weapons  [Music]  this led to many other implications as  shortly after in july active arrow  smuggling was found again by satogashi a  side effect of the previously found  glitch doing the same trick but drawing  an arrow makes the bow clip through the  floor and after waiting for a while will  cause the animation to start looping  aggressively causing some insanely cool  visual glitches  master source stealing became a reality  on the ripe day of july 4th 2021 by a  bot w the most simple trick had most  glitch hunters scratching their heads to  why this wasn't found earlier using a  campfire next to the master sword then  looking up causes a master sword to be  slightly unloaded and can be picked up  this campfire loading trick was then  used for fun in other scenarios such as  being able to save in situations  normally impossible and making enemies  have permanent ice or fire properties  jelly bouncing was another technique  found this year showing yet again the  usefulness of chuchu jellies user aozaki  1971 found that unlike elemental jellies  normal choo choo jelly specifically have  a small quirk of having a small physical  splash to push things around so by dash  attacking to break it and be on top of  it link would then be launched into the  air high enough to perform bullet time  and can be used for wind bombs or combat  bow lift smuggling slide also known as  blss was found in september of 2021  first snsk 2's finds the bow lift  smuggle which causes link to pick up an  object and a bow at the same time but  legend of link then found that holding b  and clambering over a curb would cause  link to hover and freely move about the  world this was one of the biggest  discoveries of this year and has had  huge implications for both speed runs  and casual play to let you move around  the world using no stamina or health  continuing his glitch hunting rampage  snsk 2s puts material smuggling on the  map by using a scope or a camera holding  an item then immediately holding another  item the material is then left floating  in place as an object that's liftable  this could be lyft smuggled as well just  adding to the already vast list of  smuggling types that have been found in  breath of the wild  [Music]  the initial first person glitch was a  painstaking process that took quite a  bit of work and equipment to acquire but  that process was again made easier by  snsk2s by a new discovery of the updated  new first person glitch not requiring  the difficult super hold smuggling  process found earlier this year by  weapon smuggling first then a  combination of switching equipment and  holding items then pausing and engaging  the camera at the same time first person  breath of the wild was possible anywhere  [Music]  at this point in november link has had  enough of these insane glitches wanted  to reject humanity and just return to  monkey user hanabi link finds out by  using rivali's gale then simply  unequipping a weapon and cancelling the  gale link would keep his crouched  animation from his waist up ah truly a  return to form  [Music]  finally no hozarashi discovers a way to  remove link's shika slate while still  being able to use it for rune abilities  this was found after performing an old  glitch called apparatus storage but with  the added step of loading another file  during bullet time instead now link's  mind powers were enough to use rune  abilities no need for the chica slate  while there were many other discoveries  found this year what's important to note  is that things will continue to be found  every year and in the years to come with  breath of the wild 2 fast approaching in  2022 players will be ready to find what  can be uncovered in the highly  anticipated sequel if you enjoyed this  video let us know with a like and  subscribe 